{"relation_id": "REL-20261025-427f1b", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-038"}, "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261025-c3ede7"}, "note": "一冊だけ残る詩を、ひとつの水が分かれる無主語情景へ変奏。", "created_at": "2026-10-25"}
