{"relation_id": "REL-20261025-440fc9", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261025-c3ede7"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-078"}, "note": "数える単位と対象の境界を分ける。", "created_at": "2026-10-25"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261025-ed55f0", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261025-c3ede7"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-080"}, "note": "小石を数えた値で生き物の総数を代弁しない。", "created_at": "2026-10-25"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261025-62f110", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261025-c3ede7"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-081"}, "note": "資料を増やさず旧稿の着地を変更する次の一手。", "created_at": "2026-10-25"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261025-69f446", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261025-c3ede7"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-082"}, "note": "同じ素材と問いを維持しても、結びの主張は反転できる。", "created_at": "2026-10-25"}
